WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:19.520
Come on, boys. Come on.
Head up.

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:35.953
Come on, I'm in the lead.
Can you just let me…?

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.955
Can you let me win one time?

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.623
You've already won,
like, five or six games.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.958
And I'm going easy on you.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:41.959
No!

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:43.877
-Yes!
-No!

00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:58.016
-Mr Ajayi.
-Charlie Spring.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.101
I have a question.

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:01.019
Well, I am officially
a beacon of learning,

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:02.271
so fire away.

00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:03.689
How do I stop
liking someone,

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:04.815
specifically a straight guy?

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:07.109
Ah, a question for the ages.

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:24.001
-Hi.
-Hi.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.878
-Hi.
-Hi.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.880
-Hi.
-Hi.

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:29.715
-Hi.
-Hi.

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:31.425
-Hi.
-Hi.

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.676
Hi.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.844
Hi.

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:12.716
You'll be doing the 200
meters for Team Blue,

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.384
so you need to be over
by the starting line

00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:15.344
in three minutes.

00:02:15.427 --> 00:02:16.887
Wait! What?

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:17.846
No!

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.765
No protests.

00:02:20.641 --> 00:02:21.767
Swap bibs with me.

00:02:22.351 --> 00:02:23.894
What? Why?

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.646
You hate running,
I'll run it for you.

00:02:37.741 --> 00:02:39.785
&lt;i&gt;Happy New Year, Truham Boys!&lt;/i&gt;

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:41.620
&lt;i&gt;Don't forget&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;there might be students&lt;/i&gt;

00:02:41.703 --> 00:02:44.540
&lt;i&gt;from all school years&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;in your new form groups.&lt;/i&gt;

00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:48.001
&lt;i&gt;I hope you enjoy getting&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;to know some fresh faces&lt;/i&gt;

00:02:48.085 --> 00:02:49.920
&lt;i&gt;in registration each day.&lt;/i&gt;

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.183
Hi, sir.

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:04.768
Come to join the ranks
of Hamlet House?

00:03:04.852 --> 00:03:05.811
Apparently so.

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:19.783
The guy you sit next to
in form?

00:03:19.867 --> 00:03:20.701
Who?

00:03:20.784 --> 00:03:22.202
The one that looks
like a golden retriever.

00:03:22.286 --> 00:03:24.371
He doesn't look
like a golden retriever.

00:03:25.914 --> 00:03:27.040
Okay, he does.

00:03:27.124 --> 00:03:28.625
I can't believe
you've been sat next to

00:03:28.709 --> 00:03:30.627
rugby king Nick Nelson.

00:03:30.711 --> 00:03:32.629
What are you gonna
talk about every morning?

00:03:47.728 --> 00:03:49.062
Watching me, please.

00:03:49.813 --> 00:03:51.315
With confidence please,
everybody.

00:03:51.398 --> 00:03:52.274
Come on!

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.376
I am the killer of aliens.

00:04:12.503 --> 00:04:13.462
Yes!

00:04:27.851 --> 00:04:28.769
I've got it.

00:04:28.852 --> 00:04:30.729
&lt;i&gt;Pirates of the Caribbean.&lt;/i&gt;

00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:32.523
It's a classic.
What do you think?

00:04:34.566 --> 00:04:35.609
Yeah.

00:04:36.151 --> 00:04:37.277
That sounds good.

00:04:53.043 --> 00:04:54.419
Monster Munch?

00:04:55.379 --> 00:04:57.005
Yeah, okay.

00:05:13.689 --> 00:05:16.024
So, does anyone remember
the rules of rugby?

00:05:16.108 --> 00:05:17.526
Because I don't.

00:05:17.609 --> 00:05:18.527
No.

00:05:31.748 --> 00:05:34.543
Oh, my God!
No, that is a crime.

00:05:34.626 --> 00:05:36.295
I cannot believe
you're disrespecting

00:05:36.378 --> 00:05:38.380
bubblegum flavour
in front of me.

00:05:38.463 --> 00:05:40.007
Right, let me try yours.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.180
-Wow.
-See?

00:05:46.263 --> 00:05:48.015
I make good choices.

00:06:00.736 --> 00:06:02.070
Is my hair too short?

00:06:02.154 --> 00:06:03.322
It looks the same.

00:06:03.405 --> 00:06:04.323
But is it okay?

00:06:04.406 --> 00:06:05.991
It looks the same.

00:06:07.034 --> 00:06:08.577
Great, thanks.

00:06:09.578 --> 00:06:10.913
Have fun at Nick's.

